r and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.":"Liftr m'għandux kont, m'għandux server u m'għandux reklami. It-taħriġiet, l-eżerċizzji, ir-rutini, il-kejl tal-ġisem u l-pass tal-gym tiegħek jinħażnu fuq l-apparat tiegħek u fl-iCloud privat tiegħek.","Liftr is built to keep your training private.":"Liftr inbena biex iżomm it-taħriġ tiegħek privat.","Liftr saves workouts with duration and calories and reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate. Change access in the Health app → Profile → Apps → Liftr.":"Liftr jissalva t-taħriġiet bit-tul u l-kaloriji u jaqra l-piż, il-kompożizzjoni tal-ġisem u r-rata tal-qalb fil-mistrieħ tiegħek. Biddel l-aċċess fl-app Health → Profile → Apps → Liftr.","Liftr shows what you did last time, your records and how much stronger you're getting.":"Liftr juri x'għamilt l-aħħar darba, ir-rekords tiegħek u kemm qed issir aktar b'saħħtek.","Liftr tries again automatically.":"Liftr jerġa' jipprova awtomatikament.","Log weight":"Irreġistra l-piż","Log your exercises, sets, reps and weight in seconds — no more notes.":"Irreġistra l-eżerċizzji, is-settijiet, ir-reps u l-piż tiegħek f'sekondi — bla aktar noti.","MIN":"MIN","Machine":"Magna","Make a routine":"Agħmel rutina","Mark set done":"Immarka s-sett bħala lest","Max":"Mass","Min":"Min","Minimise":"Minimizza","Morning workout":"Taħriġ ta' filgħodu","Most reps":"L-aktar reps","Muscle group":"Grupp ta' muskoli","My gym pass":"Il-pass tal-gym tiegħi","My routines":"Ir-rutini tiegħi","Name":"Isem","Name on the pass (optional)":"Isem fuq il-pass (mhux obbligatorju)","Name, e.g. Monday: legs":"Isem, eż. It-Tnejn: saqajn","New":"Ġdid","New exercise":"Eżerċizzju ġdid","New records":"Rekords ġodda","New routine":"Rutina ġdida","Next":"Li jmiss","Next exercise":"L-eżerċizzju li jmiss","No code found":"Ma nstab l-ebda kodiċi","No data in this period.":"L-ebda data f'dan il-perjodu.","No data yet":"Għad m'hemmx data","No routines yet":"Għad m'hemmx rutini","No tracking":"L-ebda traċċar","No weight yet. Log it here or connect a smart scale to Apple Health.":"Għad m'hemmx piż. Irreġistrah hawn jew qabbad miżien intelliġenti ma' Apple Health.","No workout on this day.":"L-ebda taħriġ f'dan il-jum.","No workouts this week yet — next week is a fresh start.":"L-ebda taħriġ din il-ġimgħa s'issa — il-ġimgħa d-dieħla tibda mill-ġdid.","No workouts yet":"Għad m'hemmx taħriġiet","Not connected":"Mhux imqabbad","Not done yet.":"Għadu ma sarx.","Not now":"Mhux issa","Note":"Nota","Note (optional)":"Nota (mhux obbligatorja)","Notes":"Noti","Notifications":"Notifiki","Notifications are off":"In-notifiki mitfija","Now":"Issa","Only with your permission, Liftr reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate, and saves workouts, calories, distance and weight. Health data never leaves your devices through Liftr and is never used for advertising. You can change access at any time in the Health app.":"Biss bil-permess tiegħek, Liftr jaqra l-piż, il-kompożizzjoni tal-ġisem u r-rata tal-qalb waqt il-mistrieħ tiegħek, u jsalva t-taħriġiet, il-kaloriji, id-distanza u l-piż. Id-data tas-saħħa qatt ma titlaq mill-apparati tiegħek permezz ta' Liftr u qatt ma tintuża għar-reklami. Tista' tbiddel l-aċċess fi kwalunkwe ħin fl-app Apple Health.","Open Settings":"Iftaħ is-Settings","Pass":"Pass","Paste":"Waħħal","Pause":"Pawża","Point the camera at the code on your pass":"Ipponta l-kamera lejn il-kodiċi fuq il-pass tiegħek","Pounds (lb)":"Liri (lb)","Privacy":"Privatezza","Progress":"Progress","Questions?":"Mistoqsijiet?","REPS":"REPS","REST":"MISTRIEĦ","Ready to train?":"Lest għat-taħriġ?","Records":"Rekords","Reminders":"Tfakkiriet","Reminders and the rest timer are planned on your device. There is no push server.":"It-tfakkiriet u t-timer tal-mistrieħ jiġu ppjanati fuq l-apparat tiegħek. M'hemmx server tal-push.","Reminders are planned on this device. A day you already trained (also on Apple Watch or iPad) is skipped.":"It-tfakkiriet huma ppjanati fuq dan l-apparat. Jum li fih diġà tħarrigt (anki fuq Apple Watch jew iPad) jinqabeż.","Remove exercise":"Neħħi l-eżerċizzju","Remove favourite":"Neħħi mill-favoriti","Rest":"Mistrieħ","Rest is over":"Il-mistrieħ spiċċa","Rest time":"Ħin ta' mistrieħ","Resting heart rate":"Rata tal-qalb fil-mistrieħ","Restore":"Irrestawra","Resume":"Kompli","Routines":"Rutini","SET":"SETT","START":"IBDA","Save":"Salva","Save weight and body fat":"Salva l-piż u x-xaħam tal-ġisem","Save workouts":"Salva t-taħriġiet","Saved in Apple Health":"Salvat f'Apple Health","Saved on this device only":"Salvat fuq dan l-apparat biss","Scan the card or key fob, or take a screenshot of the code in your gym's app and choose it here.":"Skennja l-karta jew il-key fob, jew ħu screenshot tal-kodiċi fl-app tal-gym tiegħek u agħżlu hawn.","Scan with camera":"Skennja bil-kamera","Screen brightness is turned up":"Id-dawl tal-iskrin miżjud","Search":"Fittex","Search exercise":"Fittex eżerċizzju","See your progress":"Ara l-progress tiegħek","Sessions":"Sessjonijiet","Set done":"Sett lest","Set {1} of {2}":"Sett {1} minn {2}","Sets":"Settijiet","Sets you didn't fill in are left out.":"Is-settijiet li ma mlejtx jitħallew barra.","Settings":"Issettjar","Shoulders":"Spallejn","Show archived":"Uri l-arkivjati","Show gym pass":"Uri l-pass tal-gym","Show the QR code or barcode at the entrance, right from Liftr.":"Uri l-kodiċi QR jew il-barcode fid-daħla, dritt minn Liftr.","Sign in to iCloud in Settings to sync with your iPad and Apple Watch. Your workouts are saved on this device.":"Idħol fl-iCloud mis-Settings biex tissinkronizza mal-iPad u l-Apple Watch tiegħek. It-taħriġiet tiegħek huma salvati fuq dan l-apparat.","Since {1}":"Minn {1}","Skip":"Aqbeż","Skip rest":"Aqbeż il-mistrieħ","Start":"Ibda","Start a workout from your watch face.":"Ibda taħriġ mill-wiċċ tal-arloġġ tiegħek.","Start an empty workout and add exercises as you go.":"Ibda taħriġ vojt u żid eżerċizzji hekk kif tkun għaddej.","Start rest timer after each set":"Ibda t-timer tal-mistrieħ wara kull sett","Start workout":"Ibda t-taħriġ","Sync problem":"Problema fis-sinkronizzazzjoni","Synced with iCloud":"Sinkronizzat mal-iCloud","Syncing between your iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch goes through your private iCloud database. The developer cannot see this data. The code of your gym pass is end-to-end encrypted.":"Is-sinkronizzazzjoni bejn l-iPhone, l-iPad u l-Apple Watch tiegħek issir permezz tad-database privata tiegħek ta' iCloud. L-iżviluppatur ma jistax jara din id-data. Il-kodiċi tal-pass tal-gym tiegħek huwa kriptat minn tarf għal tarf.","Syncing…":"Qed jissinkronizza…","TIME":"ĦIN","Tap to show at the entrance":"Agħfas biex turih fid-daħla","The camera and your photos are only used to read the code of your gym pass. Images are not saved or sent anywhere.":"Il-kamera u r-ritratti tiegħek jintużaw biss biex jinqara l-kodiċi tal-pass tal-gym tiegħek. L-istampi ma jiġux issejvjati u ma jintbagħtu imkien.","This code can't be drawn":"Dan il-kodiċi ma jistax jintwera","This month":"Dan ix-xahar","This week":"Din il-ġimgħa","This week: 1 workout, {1} lifted. Great job!":"Din il-ġimgħa: taħriġ wieħed, {1} merfugħ. Prosit!","This week: {1} workouts, {2} lifted. Great job!":"Din il-ġimgħa – taħriġiet: {1}, merfugħ: {2}. Prosit!","Time":"Ħin","Time for your next set 💪":"Ħin għas-sett li jmiss 💪","Time to train 💪":"Ħin għat-taħriġ 💪","Time trained":"Ħin ta' taħriġ","To failure":"Sal-falliment","Today":"Illum","Total volume per workout (weight × reps)":"Volum totali f'kull taħriġ (piż × reps)","Train every week for {1} weeks":"Itħarreġ kull ġimgħa – ġimgħat: {1}","Training":"Taħriġ","Training days":"Jiem tat-taħriġ","Type":"Tip","Unit":"Unità","Unknown error":"Żball mhux magħruf","Volume":"Volum","Volume per week":"Volum kull ġimgħa","Warm-up":"Tisħin","Weekly summary (Sunday 20:00)":"Sommarju ta' kull ġimgħa (il-Ħadd 20:00)","Weeks":"Ġimgħat","